  "limitations": [
    "Qualification applies only to the exact Agent versions, executable hashes, Linux x86-64 cell, rootless helper stack, and recorder release hash recorded here.",
    "The provider is a controlled loopback fixture. This proves each real CLI's request/streaming-response shape, recorder integration, correlation, isolation, and exact transport agreement without sending qualification prompts to a third party; it is not a claim about public-provider availability or server-hidden state.",
